{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38033","headline":"赠吴顚尊师 · 韩偓","name":"赠吴顚尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮酒经何代，休粮度此生。\n迹应常自浼，顚亦强爲名。\n道若千钓重，身如一羽轻。\n毫厘分象纬，袒跣揖公卿。\n狗窦号光逸，渔阳裸祢衡。\n笑雷冬蛰震，岩电夜珠明。\n月魄侵簪冷，江光逼屐清。\n半酣思救世，一手拟扶倾。\n击地嗟衰俗，看天贮不平。\n自缘怀气义，可是计烹亨。\n议论通三教，年颜称五更。\n老狂人不厌，密行鬼应惊。\n未识心相许，开襟语便诚。\n伊余常仗义，愿拜十年兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}